   "source": [
    "#### Procedimiento revisado - Booklet 9\n",
    "\n",
    "El Booklet 9 §9.3 permite reemplazar el procedimiento original de §2.2.2.1.1\n",
    "por un coeficiente dinámico:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\phi_2=\\phi_{2,\\min}+\\beta_2v_h\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "donde:\n",
    "\n",
    "- $\\phi_{2,\\min}$ = coeficiente dinámico mínimo;\n",
    "- $\\beta_2$ = coeficiente asociado a la clase de izaje;\n",
    "- $v_h$ = velocidad de izaje utilizada en la evaluación [m/s].\n",
    "\n",
    "El valor de $v_h$ depende de cómo funciona el sistema de control del izaje\n",
    "\n",
    "Los valores definidos por FEM son:\n",
    "\n",
    "| Clase de izaje | $\\beta_2$ [s/m] | $\\phi_{2,\\min}$ |\n",
    "|---|---:|---:|\n",
    "| HC1 | 0.17 | 1.05 |\n",
    "| HC2 | 0.34 | 1.10 |\n",
    "| HC3 | 0.51 | 1.15 |\n",
    "| HC4 | 0.68 | 1.20 |\n",
    "\n",
    "La elección de HC1 a HC4 depende de las características dinámicas del tipo\n",
    "específico de grúa.\n",
    "\n",
    "FEM 1.001 no asigna directamente una clase HC a una grúa Level Luffing,\n",
    "por lo que este parámetro debe ser determinado o justificado antes de adoptar\n",
    "definitivamente el procedimiento.\n",
    "\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 86,
   "id": "b31f5613",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "def coef_dinamico_BOOKLET9(HoistingClass, TypeHoist, CaseComb, Vh):\n",
    "\n",
    "    # Table T9.3.a \n",
    "    if HoistingClass == 'HC1': β2=0.17; φ2min=1.05\n",
    "    elif HoistingClass == 'HC2': β2=0.34; φ2min=1.10\n",
    "    elif HoistingClass == 'HC3': β2=0.51; φ2min=1.15\n",
    "    elif HoistingClass == 'HC4': β2=0.68; φ2min=1.20\n",
    "\n",
    "    if CaseComb in ['Case I', 'Case II']:\n",
    "        if TypeHoist == 'HD1': vh = Vh\n",
    "        elif TypeHoist in ['HD2', 'HD3']: vh = Vh\n",
    "        elif TypeHoist == 'HD4': vh = 0.5*Vh\n",
    "        elif TypeHoist == 'HD5': vh = 0\n",
    "\n",
    "    elif CaseComb == 'Case III':\n",
    "        if TypeHoist == 'HD1': vh = None\n",
    "        elif TypeHoist == 'HD2': vh = Vh\n",
    "        elif TypeHoist == 'HD3': vh = None\n",
    "        elif TypeHoist == 'HD4': vh = Vh\n",
    "        elif TypeHoist == 'HD5': vh = 0.5*Vh\n",
    "\n",
    "    φ2 = φ2min +  β2*(vh/60)\n",
    "    print(f'Coeficiente dinámico φ2: {φ2:.2f}')\n",
    "\n",
    "    return φ2"
   ]
  },
