    "## Carga de viento\n",
    "### 2.2.4.1 WIND ACTION (BOOKLET 2 (1998))\n",
    "\n",
    "La presión dinámica del viento se obtiene mediante:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "q = 0.613\\,V_s^2\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "donde:\n",
    "\n",
    "- $q$ = presión dinámica del viento, en $\\mathrm{N/m^2}$.\n",
    "- $V_s$ = velocidad de viento de diseño, en $\\mathrm{m/s}$."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 91,
   "id": "e03f2c9f",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "def carga_viento_FEM1001(Vs, Area):\n",
    "    qw = 0.613*Vs**2\n",
    "    Fw = 2.5*Area*qw\n",
    "    print(f\"Presión de velocidad:\\t\\tq = {qw/9.81:.4f} kgf/m2\")\n",
    "    print(f\"Fuerza carga suspendida:\\tq = {Fw/9.81:.4f} kgf\")\n",
    "\n",
    "    return {\"qw\":qw,\n",
    "            \"Fw\": Fw}"
   ]
  },
