    "## Casos de carga\n",
    "### FEM 1.001 - Booklet 2 - §2.3\n",
    "\n",
    "FEM define tres casos de carga para la evaluación estructural de la grúa.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Case I — Operación sin viento\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\boxed{\n",
    "\\gamma_C\\left(S_G+\\psi S_L+S_H\\right)\n",
    "}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "donde:\n",
    "\n",
    "- $S_G$ = peso propio;\n",
    "- $S_L$ = carga de trabajo;\n",
    "- $\\psi$ = coeficiente dinámico vertical;\n",
    "- $S_H$ = los **dos efectos horizontales más desfavorables** de §2.2.3, excluyendo buffers;\n",
    "- $\\gamma_C$ = coeficiente amplificador según la clasificación de la grúa.\n",
    "\n",
    "Para clasificación **A8**:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\boxed{\\gamma_C=1.20}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "### Case II — Operación con viento\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\boxed{\n",
    "\\gamma_C\\left(S_G+\\psi S_L+S_H\\right)+S_W\n",
    "}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "donde $S_W$ corresponde al **viento límite de operación**.\n",
    "\n",
    "Las aceleraciones y desaceleraciones pueden diferir respecto del Case I, ya que\n",
    "los tiempos de aceleración o frenado pueden cambiar bajo acción del viento.\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "### Case III — Cargas excepcionales\n",
    "\n",
    "Se debe considerar la condición más desfavorable entre:\n",
    "\n",
    "#### a) Grúa fuera de servicio con viento máximo\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\boxed{\n",
    "S_G+S_{W,\\max}\n",
    "}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "#### b) Impacto contra buffers\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\boxed{\n",
    "S_G+S_L+S_T\n",
    "}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "#### c) Condiciones de ensayo\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\boxed{\n",
    "S_G+\\psi\\rho_1S_L\n",
    "}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "o:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\boxed{\n",
    "S_G+\\rho_2S_L\n",
    "}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "donde:\n",
    "\n",
    "- $S_T$ = efecto de impacto contra buffers;\n",
    "- $\\rho_1$ = coeficiente de ensayo dinámico;\n",
    "- $\\rho_2$ = coeficiente de ensayo estático.\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "En resumen:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\boxed{\n",
    "\\begin{aligned}\n",
    "\\text{Case I:}   &\\quad \\gamma_C(S_G+\\psi S_L+S_H) \\\\\n",
    "\\text{Case II:}  &\\quad \\gamma_C(S_G+\\psi S_L+S_H)+S_W \\\\\n",
    "\\text{Case III:} &\\quad \\max\n",
    "\\left[\n",
    "S_G+S_{W,\\max},\n",
    "\\;\n",
    "S_G+S_L+S_T,\n",
    "\\;\n",
    "S_G+\\psi\\rho_1S_L,\n",
    "\\;\n",
    "S_G+\\rho_2S_L\n",
    "\\right]\n",
    "\\end{aligned}\n",
    "}\n",
    "$$"
   ]
  },
