   "source": [
    "## Fuerzas de inercia de la superestructura durante el giro\n",
    "### FEM 1.001 - Booklet 2 - Appendix A-2.2.3\n",
    "\n",
    "Durante una aceleración o desaceleración de giro, cada componente de la\n",
    "superestructura desarrolla una fuerza de inercia asociada a su masa y a su\n",
    "distancia respecto del eje de giro.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Aceleración angular\n",
    "\n",
    "Conocida la aceleración horizontal media $J_m$ del punto de suspensión ubicado\n",
    "a una distancia $r_s$ del eje:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\boxed{\n",
    "\\alpha=\\frac{J_m}{r_s}\n",
    "}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "donde $\\alpha$ corresponde a la aceleración angular de la superestructura.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Aceleración de cada componente\n",
    "\n",
    "Se define una coordenada firmada $x_i$ para indicar la posición del centro de\n",
    "masa de cada componente respecto del eje de giro.\n",
    "\n",
    "La distancia física al eje es:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "r_i=|x_i|\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "y la aceleración tangencial firmada es:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\boxed{\n",
    "a_i=\\alpha x_i\n",
    "}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "El signo de $x_i$ permite distinguir componentes ubicados a lados opuestos del\n",
    "eje de giro.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Fuerza media de inercia\n",
    "\n",
    "La fuerza de inercia actúa en sentido contrario a la aceleración:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\boxed{\n",
    "F_{I,i,\\mathrm{media}}[\\mathrm{kgf}]\n",
    "=\n",
    "-\\frac{m_i a_i}{g}\n",
    "}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "### Fuerza de diseño FEM\n",
    "\n",
    "Para las partes móviles distintas de la carga suspendida, FEM considera dos\n",
    "veces la fuerza media de inercia:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\boxed{\n",
    "F_{I,i,\\mathrm{FEM}}\n",
    "=\n",
    "2F_{I,i,\\mathrm{media}}\n",
    "}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "por lo tanto:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\boxed{\n",
    "F_{I,i,\\mathrm{FEM}}[\\mathrm{kgf}]\n",
    "=\n",
    "-2\\frac{m_i\\alpha x_i}{g}\n",
    "}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Estas fuerzas se aplican asociadas a los componentes que participan del giro.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Momento de inercia de masa\n",
    "\n",
    "La distribución de las masas respecto del eje vertical de giro se caracteriza mediante:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\boxed{\n",
    "I_z=\\sum_i m_i r_i^2\n",
    "}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "o equivalentemente:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\boxed{\n",
    "I_z=\\sum_i m_i x_i^2\n",
    "}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "con unidades:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "[I_z]=\\mathrm{kg\\,m^2}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "### Masa equivalente de giro\n",
    "\n",
    "Para el movimiento de *slewing*, FEM relaciona la masa equivalente con el\n",
    "momento de inercia mediante:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "m_{\\mathrm{eq}}v^2=I_z\\omega^2\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "y como:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "v=\\omega r_s\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "se obtiene:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\boxed{\n",
    "m_{\\mathrm{eq}}=\\frac{I_z}{r_s^2}\n",
    "}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Esta masa equivalente se utiliza posteriormente en el cálculo de la carga\n",
    "suspendida mediante:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\mu=\\frac{m_1}{m_{\\mathrm{eq}}}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "### Momento global de inercia\n",
    "\n",
    "Las fuerzas distribuidas generan un momento respecto del eje de giro:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "M_{I,\\mathrm{FEM}}\n",
    "=\n",
    "\\sum_i x_iF_{I,i,\\mathrm{FEM}}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "cuya magnitud puede comprobarse mediante:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\boxed{\n",
    "|M_{I,\\mathrm{FEM}}|\n",
    "=\n",
    "2\\frac{\\alpha I_z}{g}\n",
    "}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Las fuerzas $F_{I,i,\\mathrm{FEM}}$ corresponden a las acciones que se aplican\n",
    "sobre el modelo estructural. El momento total, $I_z$ y la masa equivalente se\n",
    "utilizan como parámetros globales de control y para vincular este cálculo con\n",
    "el procedimiento de la carga suspendida."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 29,
   "id": "05f93a1e",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "def inercia_estructura_giro(componentes,aceleracion_suspension_ms2,radio_suspension_m,mostrar=True):\n",
    "    \"\"\"Calcula las fuerzas de inercia de la superestructura durante el giro según FEM 1.001.\"\"\"\n",
    "\n",
    "    g=9.80665                                         # Aceleración de gravedad [m/s²]\n",
    "\n",
    "    # ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
    "    # CONTROL DE DATOS\n",
    "    # ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
    "\n",
    "    if aceleracion_suspension_ms2<=0:\n",
    "        raise ValueError('aceleracion_suspension_ms2 debe ser > 0')\n",
    "\n",
    "    if radio_suspension_m<=0:\n",
    "        raise ValueError('radio_suspension_m debe ser > 0')\n",
    "\n",
    "    # ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
    "    # ACELERACIÓN ANGULAR DEL CONJUNTO GIRATORIO\n",
    "    # ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
    "\n",
    "    alpha_rads2=aceleracion_suspension_ms2/radio_suspension_m    # alpha = a/r [rad/s²]\n",
    "\n",
    "    # ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
    "    # CÁLCULO POR COMPONENTE\n",
    "    # ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
    "\n",
    "    resultados=[]\n",
    "\n",
    "    for nombre,datos in componentes.items():\n",
    "\n",
    "        masa_kg=datos['masa_kg']                                  # Masa del componente [kg]\n",
    "        x_m=datos['x_m']                                          # Coordenada firmada del CG respecto del eje de giro [m]\n",
    "        radio_m=abs(x_m)                                          # Distancia física del CG al eje de giro [m]\n",
    "\n",
    "        if masa_kg<=0:\n",
    "            raise ValueError(f'La masa de {nombre} debe ser > 0')\n",
    "\n",
    "        # --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
    "        # ACELERACIÓN TANGENCIAL\n",
    "        # --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
    "        aceleracion_ms2=alpha_rads2*x_m                           # Aceleración tangencial firmada ai = alpha·xi [m/s²]\n",
    "\n",
    "        # --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
    "        # FUERZA DE INERCIA\n",
    "        # --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
    "        F_media_kgf=-masa_kg*aceleracion_ms2/g                    # Fuerza media de inercia, opuesta a la aceleración [kgf]\n",
    "        F_FEM_kgf=2.0*F_media_kgf                                 # FEM: 2 veces la fuerza media de inercia [kgf]\n",
    "\n",
    "        # --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
    "        # MOMENTO RESPECTO DEL EJE DE GIRO\n",
    "        # --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
    "        M_FEM_kgfm=F_FEM_kgf*x_m                                  # Momento firmado respecto del eje vertical [kgf·m]\n",
    "\n",
    "        # --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
    "        # MOMENTO DE INERCIA DE MASA\n",
    "        # --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
    "        Iz_kgm2=masa_kg*radio_m**2                                 # Aporte del componente a Iz = m·r² [kg·m²]\n",
    "\n",
    "        resultados.append({\n",
    "            'Componente':nombre,\n",
    "            'Masa [kg]':masa_kg,\n",
    "            'x CG [m]':x_m,\n",
    "            'Radio CG [m]':radio_m,\n",
    "            'Aceleración [m/s²]':aceleracion_ms2,\n",
    "            'F media inercia [kgf]':F_media_kgf,\n",
    "            'F FEM [kgf]':F_FEM_kgf,\n",
    "            'M FEM [kgf·m]':M_FEM_kgfm,\n",
    "            'Iz [kg·m²]':Iz_kgm2\n",
    "        })\n",
    "\n",
    "    # ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
    "    # TABLA Y RESULTADOS GLOBALES\n",
    "    # ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
    "\n",
    "    df=pd.DataFrame(resultados)\n",
    "\n",
    "    masa_total_kg=df['Masa [kg]'].sum()                           # Masa total del conjunto giratorio [kg]\n",
    "    Iz_total_kgm2=df['Iz [kg·m²]'].sum()                          # Momento de inercia de masa total respecto del eje z [kg·m²]\n",
    "    masa_equivalente_kg=Iz_total_kgm2/radio_suspension_m**2       # Masa equivalente FEM referida al punto de suspensión [kg]\n",
    "    F_resultante_kgf=df['F FEM [kgf]'].sum()                      # Resultante tangencial firmada de las fuerzas de inercia [kgf]\n",
    "    M_total_kgfm=df['M FEM [kgf·m]'].sum()                        # Momento total firmado respecto del eje vertical [kgf·m]\n",
    "    M_total_abs_kgfm=abs(M_total_kgfm)                            # Magnitud del momento resistente total [kgf·m]\n",
    "\n",
    "    # ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
    "    # COMPROBACIÓN GLOBAL MEDIANTE Iz\n",
    "    # ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
    "    M_check_kgfm=2.0*alpha_rads2*Iz_total_kgm2/g                  # Magnitud teórica: M = 2·alpha·Iz/g [kgf·m]\n",
    "\n",
    "    # ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
    "    # PRESENTACIÓN\n",
    "    # ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
    "\n",
    "    if mostrar:\n",
    "        print('--- FEM 1.001 | Inercia de la superestructura durante el giro ---')\n",
    "        print(f'Aceleración punto suspensión = {aceleracion_suspension_ms2:.4f} m/s²')\n",
    "        print(f'Radio punto suspensión       = {radio_suspension_m:.4f} m')\n",
    "        print(f'Aceleración angular alpha    = {alpha_rads2:.6f} rad/s²')\n",
    "        print(f'Masa giratoria considerada   = {masa_total_kg:.4f} kg')\n",
    "        print(f'Iz total                     = {Iz_total_kgm2:.4f} kg·m²')\n",
    "        print(f'Masa equivalente             = {masa_equivalente_kg:.4f} kg')\n",
    "        print(f'Fuerza resultante tangencial = {F_resultante_kgf:.4f} kgf')\n",
    "        print(f'Momento FEM total            = {M_total_kgfm:.4f} kgf·m')\n",
    "        # print(f'Magnitud momento FEM         = {M_total_abs_kgfm:.4f} kgf·m')\n",
    "        # print(f'Chequeo mediante Iz          = {M_check_kgfm:.4f} kgf·m')\n",
    "\n",
    "    return df,{\n",
    "        'alpha_rads2':alpha_rads2,\n",
    "        'masa_total_kg':masa_total_kg,\n",
    "        'Iz_total_kgm2':Iz_total_kgm2,\n",
    "        'masa_equivalente_kg':masa_equivalente_kg,\n",
    "        'F_resultante_kgf':F_resultante_kgf,\n",
    "        'M_total_kgfm':M_total_kgfm,\n",
    "        'M_total_abs_kgfm':M_total_abs_kgfm,\n",
    "        'M_check_kgfm':M_check_kgfm\n",
    "    }"
   ]
  },
